Subject: [PATCH] drm/stm: Remove redundant drm_of_panel_bridge_remove call

[ e5332eedf04f not applied due to merge conflict ]

Some changes were lost when merging the patch
"drm/stm: Avoid use-after-free issues with crtc and Plane".
The call to drm_of_panel_bridge_remove is no longer necessary
thanks to the drmm_panel_bridge_add function which frees
the bridge on unbind.

